Z||000003||terryk||06-08-2001||03:48 PM||||Diacom from Rinda Technologies. About $250 for the base kit (software and cable). $550 for the advanced, but the base kit is fine.<P>It's a bit bitchy about the parallel port. It won't work on some portables. Search the net for Diacom Portable Compatable. There are lists out there.<P>After that, Oliver Shultz has one for the V6 ECM's. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||06-08-2001||08:02 PM||||AutoXray doesn't hook up to a PC... It's a stand alone one. About $150-200us depending where you get it.<P>Diacom is generally considered the best for PC. ||||reg||1
